# License — InvaderQuest (English)

This repository contains material under **three different regimes**. Read the
section matching what you intend to reuse.

## 1. Source code and original work — all rights reserved

Copyright © 2026 Marc-Henri Colson. All rights reserved.

This covers **the whole repository except the data files listed in sections 2
and 3**, including `data/badges.js`, `data/poiFamilies.js` and
`data/privacyPolicy.js`, which are code despite their location, as well as
interface translations (`locales/`) and original artwork (`assets/`).

No permission is granted to copy, modify, distribute, publish or create
derivative works from these files, in whole or in part, in any form, without
prior written consent from the copyright holder.

The repository is public so that the application can download its data, and for
transparency. **Being able to read it does not grant a licence to reuse it.**

Contact: marchenri.colson@gmail.com

## 2. Invader and geographic data — ODbL

Files: `data/invaders.js`, `data/invaders*.json`, `data/index.json`,
`data/news.json`, `data/paris-arrondissements.json`.

Derived from the community database goguelnikov/SpaceInvaders, from pnote.eu
(statuses and additional identifiers, with the author's permission), from
[OpenStreetMap](https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright) and, for the
arrondissement boundaries, from [Paris Data](https://opendata.paris.fr).
Distributed under the
[Open Database License (ODbL) v1.0](https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/).

Credit the sources above, and **any derived database you publish must also be
under ODbL**.

## 3. Points of interest — CC0 and CC BY-SA

Files: `data/poi_PA.json`, `data/poi_PA_*.json`, `data/poi_index.json`.

Coordinates, identifiers and notability come from Wikidata, under
[CC0 1.0](https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/). Summaries, in
French, English, Spanish and Italian, are written after Wikipedia articles and
are therefore under
[CC BY-SA 4.0](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/). Photographs are
not distributed here: the files only carry links to Wikimedia Commons, each
image's own author and licence being shown in the app.

## 4. Trademarks and third-party content

"Space Invader" refers to the work of the artist Invader. This project is an
independent tool, unaffiliated with the artist. **No mosaic photograph is
distributed by this application.**
